; MM-LIFE-2d's evidence capacity. A symbolic witness reads its bit
; with a shift by the variable's index, and a shift of 64 or more is
; poison in the emitted LLVM - an arbitrary answer at run time, a
; wrong free under reference maps - so the sixty-fifth type variable
; refuses at the declaration with AX3030. The pre-evidence compiler
; accepts this whole file, exit 0.
